3. Lender
TEXT:
Banco Santander S.A., as the Lender, agrees to lend the funds necessary for the Loan Purpose to the Borrower. The Lender shall have the right to demand and receive repayment of the loan in accordance with the terms and conditions of this Agreement. The Lender shall have the right to charge and receive interest on the outstanding principal balance of the loan at the rate of 3% per annum. The Lender shall have the right to charge and receive any and all fees and expenses incurred in connection with the loan, including but not limited to, legal fees, appraisal fees, and closing costs. The Lender shall have the right to demand and receive security for the loan in the form of a mortgage or other security interest in the Borrower's assets. The Lender shall have the right to take any and all actions necessary to protect its interest in the loan, including but not limited to, filing a lawsuit against the Borrower. The Lender shall have the right to accelerate the repayment of the loan if the Borrower defaults on any payment or breaches any of the terms and conditions of this Agreement. The Lender shall have the right to waive any of its rights under this Agreement, in whole or in part, at its sole discretion.

