4. Borrower

The Borrower, Andalusian Wind Energy, Inc., acknowledges and agrees that it is a debtor in respect to the loan provided by the Lender, Banco Santander S.A., and that it shall repay the loan in accordance with the terms and conditions of this Agreement. The Borrower represents and warrants that it has the necessary authority, capacity, and financial resources to fulfill its obligations under this Agreement, and that it shall promptly make all payments required by the Agreement, including the monthly repayments of the principal and interest, starting on [date] for a duration of [duration] months. The Borrower shall also comply with all the covenants, conditions, and representations contained in this Agreement, and shall promptly notify the Lender of any changes in its financial condition, business, or other circumstances that may affect its ability to repay the loan. The Borrower agrees that in the event of any default or breach of this Agreement, the Lender shall have the right to take any and all actions necessary to protect its interest in the loan, including but not limited to, filing a lawsuit against the Borrower. The Borrower acknowledges that it is aware of the Lender's right to accelerate the repayment of the loan if it defaults on any payment or breaches any of the terms and conditions of this Agreement. The Borrower further acknowledges that the Lender shall have the right to waive any of its rights under this Agreement, in whole or in part, at its sole discretion.

5. Loan Purpose
SECTION:
The loan proceeds shall be used exclusively for the construction of wind energy farms in Spain. The Borrower represents and warrants that the loan proceeds shall be used solely for the loan purpose and for no other purpose. In the event that the Borrower uses the loan proceeds for any other purpose, the Borrower shall be in breach of this Agreement and shall be liable to the Lender for any damages resulting therefrom.

6. Jurisdiction
This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Spain. Any disputes arising out of or in connection with this Agreement shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Spain. The Borrower hereby submits to the jurisdiction of such courts for the purpose of any proceedings in respect of this Agreement.

